=\"d9d9a691a7b0cc03\" href=\"?note=d9d9a691a7b0cc03\" title=\"28-df-formula\">28-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> (公式集, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9d9a691a7b0cc03\" href=\"?note=d9d9a691a7b0cc03\" title=\"28-df-formula\">28-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{var}(t)\">\\(\\mathrm{var}(t)\\)</span> (项中变量集, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"acf90b9de82eb78c\" href=\"?note=acf90b9de82eb78c\" title=\"28-df-first-order-syntax\">28-df-first-order-syntax</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,t_1,\\ldots,t_n\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(t,t_1,\\ldots,t_n\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span> (项, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"acf90b9de82eb78c\" href=\"?note=acf90b9de82eb78c\" title=\"28-df-first-order-syntax\">28-df-first-order-syntax</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\">\\(R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\\)</span> (关系符号, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"acf90b9de82eb78c\" href=\"?note=acf90b9de82eb78c\" title=\"28-df-first-order-syntax\">28-df-first-order-syntax</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb{N}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (元数, 标准符号)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span> (变量, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"acf90b9de82eb78c\" href=\"?note=acf90b9de82eb78c\" title=\"28-df-first-order-syntax\">28-df-first-order-syntax</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi) \\coloneqq_{\\mathrm{ind}} \\begin{cases}\\mathrm{var}(t_1)\\cup\\mathrm{var}(t_2)&amp;\\varphi=(t_1\\doteq t_2)\\\\\\bigcup_{i=1}^{n}\\mathrm{var}(t_i)&amp;\\varphi=R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\\\\\mathrm{free}(\\psi)&amp;\\varphi=\\neg\\psi\\\\\\mathrm{free}(\\psi)\\cup\\mathrm{free}(\\chi)&amp;\\varphi=(\\psi\\circ\\chi),\\;\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\\\\\mathrm{free}(\\psi)\\setminus\\{x\\}&amp;\\varphi=\\forall x\\,\\psi\\;\\lor\\;\\varphi=\\exists x\\,\\psi\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi) \\coloneqq_{\\mathrm{ind}} \\begin{cases}\\mathrm{var}(t_1)\\cup\\mathrm{var}(t_2)&amp;\\varphi=(t_1\\doteq t_2)\\\\\\bigcup_{i=1}^{n}\\mathrm{var}(t_i)&amp;\\varphi=R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\\\\\mathrm{free}(\\psi)&amp;\\varphi=\\neg\\psi\\\\\\mathrm{free}(\\psi)\\cup\\mathrm{free}(\\chi)&amp;\\varphi=(\\psi\\circ\\chi),\\;\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\\\\\mathrm{free}(\\psi)\\setminus\\{x\\}&amp;\\varphi=\\forall x\\,\\psi\\;\\lor\\;\\varphi=\\exists x\\,\\psi\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{free}(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\varphi\\in\\Gamma}\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{free}(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\varphi\\in\\Gamma}\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>该结构递归覆盖原子公式、联结词和量词三类构造。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>来源状态：本目录的自足支撑定义；不把此形式语言包装或模型论扩展冒称原书编号定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-free-variable-—-自由变量-$\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)$","text":"df-free-variable — 自由变量 $\\mathrm{free}(\\varphi)$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"d9d9a691a7b0cc03","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-f